<title>BELGIUM: EU says reviews Promodes control of Gruppo G.</title>
<headline>EU says reviews Promodes control of Gruppo G.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday it had started a preliminary probe into the increased stake taken by French retailer Promodes SA in Italian hyper and supermarket Gruppo G Srl.</p>
<p>It said the deal was submitted for clearance on November 13 under the merger regulation 4064/89. The Commission has a month from that date to clear the operation or start a four-month in-depth investigation.</p>
<p>Promodes said in September it had raised its stake in Gruppo G to 80 percent from 34.5 percent.</p>
</text>
